n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:92.253468464796%; left:19.130160300885%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:63.184981680132%; left:58.884230582908%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Sirius_FK\" title=\"IK Sirius FK\">Sirius</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:93.712924547986%; left:21.246629962397%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborg</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:67.422629104525%; left:39.149569060051%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:40.924540127242%; left:33.993480462926%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96stersunds_FK\" title=\"Östersunds FK\">Östersund</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i allsvenskan 2018.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018</b> var den 94:e säsongen av <a href=\"/wiki/Allsvenskan_(fotboll)\" title=\"Allsvenskan (fotboll)\">allsvenskan</a> sedan starten 1924 och var Sveriges högsta liga i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotboll\" title=\"Fotboll\">fotboll</a> 2018.\nRegerande mästare inför säsongen var <a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö FF</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> I den sista omgången stod <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a> som <a href=\"/wiki/Svenska_m%C3%A4stare_i_fotboll\" title=\"Svenska mästare i fotboll\">svenska mästare 2018</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag\">Lag</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>16 lag har kvalificerat sig för spel i fotbollsallsvenskan 2018 efter resultat från <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2017\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2017\">allsvenskan 2017</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2017\" title=\"Superettan 2017\">superettan 2017</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Städer_och_arenor\"><span id=\"St.C3.A4der_och_arenor\"></span>Städer och arenor</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Städer och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Städer och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"130\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"140\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Ort\n</th>\n<th width=\"130\">Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2017\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\"><img alt=\"Stockholms län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Solna_kommun\" title=\"Solna kommun\">Solna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Friends_Arena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Friends Arena\">Friends Arena</a>\n</td>\n<td>Gräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;050000.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>50&#160;000\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">b &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">2</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">BK Häcken</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6talands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Västra Götalands län\"><img alt=\"Västra Götalands län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6taland_vapen.svg/20px-V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6taland_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6taland_vapen.svg/40px-V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6taland_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6talands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Västra Götalands län\">Västra Götaland</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"Göteborg\">Göteborg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bravida_Arena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bravida Arena\">Bravida Arena</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;06500.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>6&#160;500\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">d &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">4</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dalkurd_FF\" title=\"Dalkurd FF\">Dalkurd FF</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Gävleborgs län\"><img alt=\"Gävleborgs län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Gävleborgs län\">Gävleborg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%A4vle\" title=\"Gävle\">Gävle</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gavlevallen\" title=\"Gavlevallen\">Gavlevallen</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;06432.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>6&#160;432\n</td>\n<td><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">p &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">2</span> <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2017\" title=\"Superettan 2017\">S1</a>)</small>\n</td><